' 14 Phase Gantt chart: the days of each phase of the campaign, from the
' realignment P0 to P11, and the phase that has no date.
'
' Source of Figure 1 in ../README.md (section "Status of the phases"). The
' figure restates Table 2 of that section and the dates of the commits in the
' git history of the branch (author dates, local time of the development
' host). It adds no new fact.
'
' Reading order, from the top to the bottom:
'   1. The realignment P0: the backup, the restore and the ledger record.
'   2. The foundations: the substrate (P1), the marker encoding (P2), and the
'      parser and the normalizers (P3), which ran in the parser worktree in
'      parallel with P2 and P4.
'   3. The space families: the first family (P4), the merge of
'      feature/cost-accounted-rho (decision 44, a milestone), the decisions
'      42, 43, 45 and 46, the other disciplines and outer stores (P5), native
'      execution (decision 47), VectorDB and ChromaDB (P6), and the temp and
'      seq qualifiers, HashSet, theories and rehydration (P7).
'   4. The user agent-backed spaces (P8) and the consensus integration (P9).
'   5. The verification and the documents (P10), and the final gate set
'      (P11), which overlaps the last days of P10.
'   6. A note gives the steps of P10, the gate set of P11, and P12, which has
'      no date: P12 waits for the readiness signal of F1r3lang (SIG-F).
'
' Changed by decision 137: P11 ran the final gate set on a development host,
' and pgmcp ran no leaf. The text before, in the note of the figure:
' '   **Phases with no date**
' '   P11 follows P10: one pgmcp freeze registers the recipes and runs the
' '   verifier for every active leaf (decision 75), with the final gates.
'
' Each bar covers the days from the first commit of its phase to its closing
' commit. The label of each bar names the closing commit.
'
' Colors: the shared palette and concept-colors.iuml. The aliases $g_* below
' give each kind of work a color. Each alias names a palette variable, so this
' file holds no hexadecimal color code.
' Render: ./render.sh 14-phase-gantt.puml   Check: ./render.sh --check

@startgantt 14-phase-gantt
!include ../../../casper/theory/diagrams/palette.iuml
!include concept-colors.iuml

' Kinds of work of this figure.
' The realignment of the codex work (P0).
!$g_realign = $rrs_reserved
' The storage substrate of P1.
!$g_substrate = $rrs_substrate
' The syntax: the marker encoding and the parser.
!$g_syntax = $rrs_syntax
' The space families and the agents that serve them.
!$g_spaces = $rrs_agent
' The changes that apply to every family: the merge and the decisions.
!$g_decision = $rrs_tag
' The consensus integration.
!$g_consensus = $rrs_storage
' The verification and the documents of P10, and the final gate set of P11.
!$g_verification = $rrs_system
' The border of every bar.
!$g_border = $rrs_relation

$ca_base_skin()
title Phases of the Reified RSpaces campaign: the days from the first commit to the closing commit of each phase
Project starts 2026-10-04
printscale daily zoom 3

